# --- toolchains and vendored clones ---------------------------------------
.venv/
.browsers/
Scrapling/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# --- scraped media ---------------------------------------------------------
# research/ is ~1 GB once media is counted: 604 MB of .png (Dribbble captures),
# 246 MB of .jpg, 107 MB of .mp4. GitHub hard-rejects any single file over
# 100 MB, so this could never be committed as-is.
#
# Ignored by extension rather than by directory, so the ~3.5 MB of parsed JSON
# under research/brand/ - which is what the generator scripts actually read -
# still lands in the repo. A fresh clone can rebuild every page from it.
research/**/*.png
research/**/*.jpg
research/**/*.jpeg
research/**/*.webp
research/**/*.gif
research/**/*.mp4
research/**/*.html
research/**/*.bin

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
